        "TileImage": "$($repository a8285614-671d-486e-91b2-20ffb8754d24).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. \rYour target is Mabaya Mzabuni, the representative of the terror organisation &apos;Crystal Dawn&apos;, which is involved  in trading weapons, slaves, and drugs, alongside diamond smuggling and domestic terrorism. Mabaya bought tickets to an IAGO auction some time ago and he made an appearance there today. It was his fault that a plane was brutally shot down gunned the African jungle.  \rEliminate the target, avoiding all collateral damages. \rGood luck 47. \rMission status: ACTIVE",
